WEBVTT

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:50.430
A page is blocks: headings, paragraphs, lists, tables, callouts... Markdown shortcuts work as you type.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:01:04.980
Select words and format them from the toolbar - or with Ctrl+B, Ctrl+I, Ctrl+U.

00:01:04.980 --> 00:01:36.140
Type "/" for blocks: callout, table, quote, code, to-dos, picture, video, PDF, file...

00:01:36.140 --> 00:02:01.160
A checklist block: title, items and notes - three levels deep. Tick a box when it is done.

00:02:01.160 --> 00:02:09.000
Ctrl+Shift+D stamps the date and time. Type @ to link another page.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:14.733
Everything is saved as you type. Ctrl+Z works across the whole session.

